      "fix": "Track completion per effect or per resolution-stage, not with one filed bit set before downstream effects. Persist landed CRM/page/task tokens and retry every absent required effect idempotently; add failures after distinct-page History and after the first task, then assert the next run completes every missing effect without duplicating landed ones."
